 for food and water now  everything is here we have houses a  school and the produce we grow keeps us  healthy and that's good because there  are no doctors here the village is  receiving important visitors today along  with a government representative a UN  delegation is in town the UN is  supporting the project in cooperation  with the European Union and World Bank  if you want to fight climate change if  you want to fight against soul  degradation because there is soil  degradation here you need to have this  kind of conservative approaches you need  to to think in terms of agro ecology to  use less fertilizer less pesticide so  for the people of coyly alpha are just  happy that they're profiting from the  motto project and they hope that  Senegal's government will continue to  pump water and money into their village  [Music]
 

